% Keys are the first author's surname and the year -- Wood2003, Wood2017 --
% with the letters only, so a surname with a space, a hyphen or an accent
% keys as vanBuuren2011, GoodmanBacon2021, Hernan2020. A key, once used, is
% never reused for another work: documents cite these keys.
%
% Every entry is cited in an @references block, and every @references entry
